      "updated": 1792780869120,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IP address = the address of a\nbuilding. Every device on a network\ngets one, so others can find it.\n\n127.0.0.1 = 'this building'. Every\ncomputer has it, and it always means\nitself. Its name is localhost.",
